 "words_heard": 150,
 "words": 214,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Johanan came to Mizpah with the commanders",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He spoke of a plot that hung in the air",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Baalis king of Ammon had sent a man",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Ishmael son of Nethaniah was the danger",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He said strike him down before he strikes you",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Scatter the Judeans who gather around",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But Gedaliah refused to believe the news",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He said the words about Ishmael are not true",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Baalis king of Ammon sent the blade",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To kill the governor appointed by fate",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 53.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The remnant of Judah is left to bleed",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 53.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "While Ishmael son of Nethaniah leads the deed",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 53.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "In the seventh month they sat to eat",
   "heard": 0,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": null,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Ten men rose up with the sword at their feet",
   "heard": 0,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": null,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Gedaliah fell and the Chaldeans died",
   "heard": 0,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": null,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The fighting men who stood by his side",
   "heard": 0,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": null,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Baalis king of Ammon sent the blade",
   "heard": 1,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 19.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "To kill the governor appointed by fate",
   "heard": 0,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": null,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The remnant of Judah is left to bleed",
   "heard": 0,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": null,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "While Ishmael son of Nethaniah leads the deed",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.04,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Ishmael fled with eight men to Ammon",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Back to the king who had set the plan",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The remnant moved toward the land of Egypt",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Afraid of the Chaldeans and the debt they might pay",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They did not obey the voice of the Lord",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And went to Tahpanhes with the sword",
   "heard": 6,
